{"seq":2,"slug":"subscription-pricing-proration-lifecycle","title":"订阅计划、定价与升降级按比例结算（订阅生命周期、试用转正、proration 与信用额度）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/tenant-billing-metering/subscription-pricing-proration-lifecycle","wordCount":2594,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"订阅计划-定价与升降级按比例结算-订阅生命周期-试用转正-proration-与信用额度\">订阅计划、定价与升降级按比例结算（订阅生命周期、试用转正、proration 与信用额度）</h1><p>一个跨境电商 SaaS 平台的租户在月中把 Starter 换成 Growth，同时加购两个店铺名额、去掉一个已停用的插件。在计费系统里这产生两笔方向相反的金额：旧套餐未使用部分要<strong>退回</strong>（credit），新套餐剩余部分要<strong>补收</strong>（debit）。两笔的净值决定租户当月付多少、下月账单起点在哪、平台该不该立刻调支付网关。按比例结算（proration）做错的后果是收入漏记、租户被重复扣款、企业客户年结时账单对不上。本文只写计费这一层；租户能用到哪些功能由权益层决定，见 <a href=\"../saas-multi-tenant-model/tenant-tier-entitlement-quota\"><code>../1_saas-multi-tenant-model/3_tenant-tier-entitlement-quota.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"订阅是一个状态机-不是一个价格字段\">订阅是一个状态机，不是一个价格字段</h2><p>把订阅当成「租户表上的 <code>plan_id</code> 列」是多数自研计费系统的第一个错误。订阅是随时间推进、由事件驱动的状态机，状态迁移本身就是计费动作的触发源。Stripe Billing 把状态定义为 <code>trialing</code> / <code>active</code> / <code>incomplete</code> / <code>incomplete_expired</code> / <code>past_due</code> / <code>unpaid</code> / <code>paused</code> / <code>canceled</code>（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/webhooks\">Stripe Billing subscription webhooks</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Create[&quot;创建订阅&lt;br/&gt;tenant_id + price&quot;] --&gt; Trial{&quot;是否含试用?&quot;}&#10;  Trial --&gt;|是| Trialing[&quot;trialing&lt;br/&gt;锚定 trial_start&quot;]&#10;  Trial --&gt;|否| Active[&quot;active&quot;]&#10;  Trialing --&gt;|试用结束&lt;br/&gt;trial_will_end 预通知| Convert[&quot;转正&lt;br/&gt;全周期或按比例账单&quot;]&#10;  Convert --&gt; Active&#10;  Active --&gt;|升级 加价| Active&#10;  Active --&gt;|降级 生成 credit| Active&#10;  Active --&gt;|收款失败| PastDue[&quot;past_due&lt;br/&gt;进入重试计划&quot;]&#10;  PastDue --&gt;|重试成功| Active&#10;  PastDue --&gt;|重试耗尽| End[&quot;canceled / unpaid / paused&quot;]&#10;  Active --&gt;|cancel_at_period_end| Canceled[&quot;到期不续&quot;]\">graph TD\n  Create[\"创建订阅&lt;br/&gt;tenant_id + price\"] --&gt; Trial{\"是否含试用?\"}\n  Trial --&gt;|是| Trialing[\"trialing&lt;br/&gt;锚定 trial_start\"]\n  Trial --&gt;|否| Active[\"active\"]\n  Trialing --&gt;|试用结束&lt;br/&gt;trial_will_end 预通知| Convert[\"转正&lt;br/&gt;全周期或按比例账单\"]\n  Convert --&gt; Active\n  Active --&gt;|升级 加价| Active\n  Active --&gt;|降级 生成 credit| Active\n  Active --&gt;|收款失败| PastDue[\"past_due&lt;br/&gt;进入重试计划\"]\n  PastDue --&gt;|重试成功| Active\n  PastDue --&gt;|重试耗尽| End[\"canceled / unpaid / paused\"]\n  Active --&gt;|cancel_at_period_end| Canceled[\"到期不续\"]</pre><p>两个工程含义。第一，<strong><code>trialing</code> 与 <code>active</code> 是同一订阅的两种状态，不是两种商品</strong>：试用结束后同一台状态机推进，不必建第二张订阅记录。第二，<strong>迁移必须由事件而非定时扫描驱动</strong>：平台收到迁移 webhook 后再开通或回收店面权限，否则出现&quot;已付费但店面仍锁着&quot;的空窗期，这与 onboarding 流程强耦合，见 <a href=\"../saas-multi-tenant-model/tenant-storefront-provisioning-onboarding\"><code>../1_saas-multi-tenant-model/2_tenant-storefront-provisioning-onboarding.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-按比例结算的三要素-计量口径-时间锚点-余额处置\">核心概念：按比例结算的三要素（计量口径、时间锚点、余额处置）</h2><p>proration 的算式简单，制造争议的是三个参数。</p>\n<p><strong>计量口径</strong>决定一天值多少钱。Chargebee 用站点级开关 <code>Settings &gt; Configure Chargebee &gt; Billing LogIQ &gt; Proration Mode</code> 选择 <strong>Day-based</strong>（按周期内日历天数）或 <strong>Millisecond-based</strong>（精确到毫秒，默认值）；Stripe 默认按<strong>秒</strong>计算，改粒度需写自定义脚本（来源：<a href=\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/proration.html\">Chargebee Proration</a>、<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/prorations\">Stripe Proration</a>）。口径差异在 31 天月份里约合 3% 金额误差，且对账时无法向租户解释——Chargebee 记录生产站点从 millisecond-based 切到 day-based <strong>不可逆</strong>，所以上线前就得定死。</p>\n<p>设旧价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{old}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、新价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_{start}, t_{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>、变更时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，剩余比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mro