ace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = P_{new}\\cdot r \\;-\\; P_{old}\\cdot r \\;=\\; r\\,(P_{new}-P_{old})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即<strong>净值只与价差和剩余比例有关</strong>，与绝对价格无关——这是&quot;升级补差价、降级退差价&quot;的数学来源。Chargebee 算例：Day-based 下 $300 升 $600、31 天月剩 22 天，产生 $212.90 credit、$425.81 charge、净值 $212.91（来源同上）。</p>\n<p><strong>时间锚点</strong>决定用哪个时刻算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>。请求处理耗时数秒，&quot;到达时刻&quot;与&quot;落库时刻&quot;算出的金额就不同，预览价与实际扣款对不上。Stripe 的解法是显式传 <code>proration_date</code>：先用 <code>invoice create_preview</code> 预览，再用<strong>同一个</strong> <code>proration_date</code> 执行更新，两次计算才严格相等（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/prorations\">Stripe Proration</a>）。\n<strong>余额处置</strong>决定 credit 落到哪里，也是产品差异最大、最易引发投诉的一处：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>当前账单状态</th>\n<th>credit 性质</th>\n<th>处置方式</th>\n<th>风险点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>未付 / payment due</td>\n<td>Adjustment</td>\n<td>减少本期应缴额</td>\n<td>与重开全额账单叠加会双收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已付</td>\n<td>Refundable</td>\n<td>冲抵未来账单，不退现金</td>\n<td>租户以为&quot;降级会退钱&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分已付</td>\n<td>拆分</td>\n<td>一部分抵扣欠费、一部分留余额</td>\n<td>拆分比例须在对账口径说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无历史扣款（试用/换价）</td>\n<td>依 billing_mode</td>\n<td>classic 按当前价、flexible 按最后实收价</td>\n<td>金额可能相差整个周期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Stripe 在这点上必须由平台显式确认：<strong>负数的比例配分不会自动退款，正数的比例配分也不会立即扣款</strong>，除非把 <code>proration_behavior</code> 设为 <code>always_invoice</code>。<code>classic</code> 与 <code>flexible</code> 对 credit 的计算基数不同——同一串&quot;先不按比例升级、再按比例降级&quot;的操作，<code>classic</code> 算得账单合计 <code>-334</code>、<code>flexible</code> 算得 <code>0</code>，因为前者按当前价格给 credit（即使该价格从未被支付），后者按<strong>最后一次实收价格</strong>给 credit（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/prorations\">Stripe Proration</a>）。跨境平台若混用两种模式，毛利对账会出现系统性偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等-乱序与-按比例开关-的粘滞效应\">幂等、乱序与&quot;按比例开关&quot;的粘滞效应</h2><p>计费变更的失败模式几乎都不在算式里，而在重放与时序上：一次升级同时触发订阅更新、账单生成、权益变更 webhook、支付尝试、计量周期重置，任何一环重试都可能把净值算两遍。三条硬约束：变更操作必须带幂等键去重，重放返回同一结果而非重算；webhook 先验签、再按事件时间戳而非到达顺序落库（<code>customer.subscription.updated</code> 可能在 <code>invoice.paid</code> 之后到达）；禁止在 proration 之外由应用层再算一次差价直接调网关——与计费引擎叠加就是重复扣款，这正是 Stripe 建议用 <code>proration_behavior=none</code> 并<strong>作废未付账单</strong>来避免双付的场景（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/prorations\">Stripe Proration</a>）。\nChargebee 记录了一条反直觉但必须写进平台 UI 的规则：<strong>若同一计费周期内对某次变更关闭了比例配分，该周期内后续变更也不会产生比例配分</strong>，即使之后重新开启；早前未使用期间的 credit 不会被补算（来源：<a href=\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/proration.html\">Chargebee Proration</a>）。&quot;按比例开关&quot;在一个周期内因此有<strong>粘滞效应</strong>，自助升降级页面必须把这条规则翻译成租户能懂的话术。</p>\n<p>另有三类变更<strong>根本不该产生 proration</strong>，从变更 API 里排除能省掉对账噪音：仅改元数据、仅增删折扣/优惠券、仅改 <code>cancel_at_period_end</code>。反过来，<strong>按用量计费的部分不参与比例配分</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/prorations\">Stripe Proration</a>）——&quot;订单量超出套餐包&quot;这类超额费用应走计量管道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"试用转正-免费与付费试用的分岔-以及合规硬底线\">试用转正：免费与付费试用的分岔，以及合规硬底线</h2><p>试用是转化率工具，也是分支最多的一段，至少在模型上要分开两种情况：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>免费试用（0 元）</th>\n<th>付费/折扣试用（&gt;0 元）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订阅状态</td>\n<td><code>trialing</code></td>\n<td><code>active</code> / <code>incomplete</code> / <code>past_due</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>走 PaymentIntent 生命周期</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是，需即时成功支付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计入 MRR</td>\n<td>否（试用期不计入 MRR）</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无支付方式时</td>\n<td>默认建发票，可选取消或暂停</td>\n<td>同左</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Stripe 自 API 版本 <code>2026-09-30.endive</code> 起用 <strong>Trial Offer</strong> 统一免费与折扣试用：<code>duration.type=relative</code> + <code>duration.relative.iterations</code> 定义长度，<code>end_behavior.transition.price</code> 指定转正价格，并要求订阅处于 <code>billing_mode=flexible</code>（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/trials\">Stripe trials</a>）。三个必须记住的边界：Trial Offer 与旧参数 <code>trial_end</code> <strong>互斥</strong>，且不支持 Checkout / Payment Links / Elements；<strong>试用期不重置 <code>billing_cycle_anchor</code></strong>，试用项隐式锚定 <code>trial_start</code>，因此 2 月 28 日开始的 2 个月试用在 4 月 28 日结束而非 4 月 30 日，转正时用 <code>trial_settings.end_behavior.billing_cycle_anchor</code> 选 <code>now</code>（默认，全周期非比例配分账单）或 <code>unchanged</code>（按比例配分到下一锚点）；无支付方式的处置由 <code>trial_settings.end_behavior.missing_payment_method</code> 决定为 <code>create_invoice</code>（默认）、<code>cancel</code> 或 <code>pause</code>，但<strong>预收费（prebilling）优先于该设置</strong>。</p>\n<p>合规层面有一条硬底线，且它是<strong>卡组织规则</strong>而非平台可自选的策略。Visa 要求试用/促销订阅提供清晰的转正披露与取消途径，Stripe 据此提供：试用结束前 <strong>7 天</strong>发送提醒邮件（试用 ≤7 天则在开始时立即发送），<code>customer.subscription.trial_will_end</code> 事件可托管自有提醒（Dashboard 默认在结束前 <strong>3 天</strong>触发），账单描述符约 22 字符上限、第 10 字符后被 <code>* TRIAL OVER</code> 覆盖（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/subscriptions/trials/manage-trial-compliance\">Stripe trial compliance</a>）。租户自建的试用活动也继承平台的披露义务，提醒邮件的开关与文案需作为租户配置暴露，并保留发送记录作为争议证据。</p>\n<p>监管在 2026 年处于重构期，不能按旧规则写死。美国 FTC 的 Negative Option Rule（&quot;click-to-cancel&quot;）于 2024 年 10 月 16 日公布最终规则；随后 FTC 于 <strong>2026 年 2 月 12 日</strong>发布联邦公报通知修订该规则并撤回 CARS 规则以符合联邦法院判决，<strong>2026 年 3 月 13 日</strong>发布新的立法预告（案卷号 <strong>FTC-2026-0265</strong>）征求意见（来源：<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/legal-library/browse/rules/negative-option-rule\">FTC Negative Option Rule</a>）。合规姿态应是&quot;按最严的州法与卡组织规则实现取消与披露，同时跟踪联邦层面重构&quot;，而不是赌某一版联邦规则生效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收款失败后的降级路径\">收款失败后的降级路径</h2><p>试用转正、续费、升级补差都可能在支付环节失败，失败后的处置决定租户是&quot;临时扣款失败&quot;还是&quot;流失&quot;。Stripe 的 Smart Retries 用模型选择重试时机，官方推荐的默认策略是<strong>在 2 周内重试 8 次</strong>，可选窗口为 1 周 / 2 周 / 3 周 / 1 个月 / 2 个月；重试耗尽后订阅走向 <code>canceled</code>（取消）、<code>unpaid</code>（标记未付，账单继续生成但保持草稿）、<code>past_due</code>（保持逾期继续收款）或 <code>paused</code>（恢复前不再生成新账单）四个分支（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/billing/revenue-recovery/smart-retries\">Stripe Smart Retries</a>）。\n有两类失败<strong>不会被自动重试</strong>，必须由业务侧介入：无支付方式，以及发卡行返回硬拒付码（如 <code>lost_card</code>、<code>stolen_card</code>、<code>pickup_card</code>、<code>authentication_required</code>、<code>highest_risk_level</code>）。平台的正确做法是把 <code>invoice.payment_failed</code> 的 <code>attempt_count</code> 与 <code>next_payment_attempt</code> 映射到租户侧&quot;账户健康&quot;看板，并让<strong>暂停</strong>成为默认分支而非直接取消——跨境电商商家季节性极强，一次旺季后的扣款失败不该等于永久流失；但暂停期间是否保留其店面数据、订单历史、库存同步通道，要在数据隔离策略下明确，见 <a href=\"../saas-multi-tenant-model/tenant-isolation-model-archetypes\"><code>../1_saas-multi-tenant-model/1_tenant-isolation-model-archetypes.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-落到实现上的检查清单\">小结：落到实现上的检查清单</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>变更单是唯一真相</strong>：每次升降级生成带幂等键的记录，落库 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{old}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、净值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与所用 <code>proration_date</code>，可离线重放。</li>\n<li><strong>锚点与口径冻结</strong>：预览与执行共用同一 <code>proration_date</code>；Day-based 或 Millisecond-based 定为站点基线，生产环境不切换。</li>\n<li><strong>余额语义对租户可见</strong>：credit 是抵扣还是可退、留在本期还是未来账单，在自助页面写明；并标注&quot;按比例开关&quot;的周期内粘滞效应。</li>\n<li><strong>披露与重试自动化</strong>：试用结束前 7 天提醒、<code>trial_will_end</code> 接入、描述符含试用文本、取消入口可直达；默认 2 周 8 次重试，硬拒付码转人工，耗尽后默认暂停保留数据；用量与一次性费用走计量，不进 proration。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这四条共同保证：租户看到的账单金额，与平台账本上的收入确认，在每一次状态迁移后都能对上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"订阅计划、定价与升降级按比例结算（订阅生命周期、试用转正、proration 与信用额度）","id":"订阅计划-定价与升降级按比例结算-订阅生命周期-试用转正-proration-与信用额度"},{"level":2,"text":"订阅是一个状态机，不是一个价格字段","id":"订阅是一个状态机-不是一个价格字段"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：按比例结算的三要素（计量口径、时间锚点、余额处置）","id":"核心概念-按比例结算的三要素-计量口径-时间锚点-余额处置"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等、乱序与\"按比例开关\"的粘滞效应","id":"幂等-乱序与-按比例开关-的粘滞效应"},{"level":2,"text":"试用转正：免费与付费试用的分岔，以及合规硬底线","id":"试用转正-免费与付费试用的分岔-以及合规硬底线"},{"level":2,"text":"收款失败后的降级路径","id":"收款失败后的降级路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：落到实现上的检查清单","id":"小结-落到实现上的检查清单"}],"prev":{"title":"用量计量维度与聚合口径（计量事件、计费单位、GMV/订单/存储/API 调用聚合、幂等与迟到事件）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/tenant-billing-metering/usage-metering-dimensions-aggregation"},"next":{"title":"账单发票、催收重试与收入确认对账（支付失败 dunning、退款/呆账、税务与收入确认异常）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/tenant-billing-metering/billing-invoice-dunning-revenue-recognition"}}